This Bachelor program was approved by the Ministry of Work and Social Affairs of Hungary. This Bachelor degree is offered at Váci Eötvös University. The number of students on this bachelor degree is limited to 50.
Admissions: - The student has no right to admission if he/she doesn´t meet the following conditions:
1) have obtained high school diploma, as defined by Hungarian law;
2) have Hungarian citizenship;
3) be able to attend classes at English language level, with a score that is at least level B1 according to the Common European Framework of Reference for Languages.(the result must be issued three months before entering study at CEU);
4) meet all language requirements; it is also necessary that students have good command over spoken, read, written and listening skills;
5) meet all other criteria required from HE board.  
